{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o057b","title":"孙权遣吕范拒曹休诸葛瑾潘璋杨粲救南郡朱桓拒曹仁","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o057b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权遣吕范拒曹休诸葛瑾潘璋杨粲救南郡朱桓拒曹仁","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"id":"zhanggu-a-72b4aa81f8e5db981412","label":"裴注·吴录","text":"江陵之围瑾以大兵救援真等退走","evidence":["zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-cd4c4c0a768e466cedd0","label":"正文","text":"权遣将军孙盛督万人备州上，立围坞，为然外救；郃渡兵攻盛，盛不能拒，即时却退；郃据州上围守，然中外断绝","evidence":["zhulv-q-ee40aacbf6f8efe027c7"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-957377850a810e671a06","label":"正文","text":"权遣潘璋、杨粲等解〔围〕，而围不解","evidence":["zhulv-q-dd959cac71c7a1159a2e"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-52dadb8ed695bed8e4fc","label":"正文","text":"黄武元年，魏使大司马曹仁步骑数万向濡须；仁欲以兵袭取州上，伪先扬声欲东攻羡溪","evidence":["zhulv-q-150286fc1d8c46dd011b"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-b1986bf47b58704794b1","label":"正文","text":"桓分兵将赴羡溪；既发，猝得仁进军距濡须七十里问；桓遣使追还羡溪兵，兵未到而仁奄至；时桓手下及所部兵在者五千人，诸将业业，各有惧心","evidence":["zhulv-q-3e1cf6b834a280c88d70"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-645ee687e2f216e0d7f4","label":"正文","text":"桓喻诸将曰：两军交对，胜负在将不在众寡；仁非智勇、士卒怯、千里疲困，我共据高城，以逸待劳，为主制客，百战百胜；虽曹丕自来尚不足忧，况仁等邪","evidence":["zhulv-q-e54860898085b1ff7771"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-a484198f8d3e93889209","label":"正文","text":"桓因偃旗鼓，外示虚弱，以诱致仁","evidence":["zhulv-q-9849145c4d07009638e5"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-a4f920dcebc4aed7a72e","label":"正文","text":"仁果遣其子泰攻濡须城；分遣将军常雕督诸葛虔、王双等，乘油船别袭中洲（部曲妻子所在）；仁自将万人留橐皋，复为泰等后拒","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-471f9f1928d4617cde19","label":"正文","text":"桓部兵将攻取油船，或别击雕等；桓等身自拒泰；泰烧营而退，遂枭雕，生虏双，送武昌；临阵斩溺，死者千余","evidence":["zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-4945600b702f75c5bcb0","label":"正文","text":"权嘉桓功，封嘉兴侯，迁奋武将军，领彭城相","evidence":["zhulv-q-021a50d9b1b8fdeac66f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"部署","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0157","role":"拒守","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"救援","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0055","role":"救援","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0027","role":"救援","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0028","role":"拒守","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0038","role":"等围朱然于江陵又分据中州、退走","evidence":["zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0063","role":"同围者","evidence":["zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0046","role":"被围于江陵者","evidence":["zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c"]},{"person":"identity-six-20261024-p-sun-sheng-wu","role":"受遣备州上而却退者","evidence":["zhulv-q-ee40aacbf6f8efe027c7"]},{"person":"wudi-p0183","role":"攻盛据州上者","evidence":["zhulv-q-ee40aacbf6f8efe027c7"]},{"person":"cao-ren","role":"向濡须而扬声者；奄至者；所料之敌（背景）；被诱者（背景）；遣将自留者","evidence":["zhulv-q-150286fc1d8c46dd011b","zhulv-q-3e1cf6b834a280c88d70","zhulv-q-e54860898085b1ff7771","zhulv-q-9849145c4d07009638e5","zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0039","role":"攻濡须城者；烧营而退者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29","zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0038","role":"袭中洲者；被枭者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29","zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d"]},{"person":"zhulv-p0018","role":"同袭中洲者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29"]},{"person":"identity-six-20261024-p-wang-shuang-captive","role":"同袭中洲者；被生虏者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29","zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":222,"label":"秋九月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y222","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o054","basis":"秋九月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o057b-q","wuzhu-q-o054","guanzhang-q-o034","guanzhang-q-b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o057b-q","source_order":[47,297,"O057b"],"order":8220},{"id":"chenghuang-e-o148","title":"潘璋作筏拟烧浮桥未发夏侯尚先退","accounts":[{"id":"chenghuang-a-948546724f4aacb4ff7f","label":"正文","text":"潘璋作筏拟烧浮桥未发夏侯尚先退","evidence":["chenghuang-q-dc55f52f75ab6b5a64ff"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0055","role":"曰魏势始盛江水又浅未可与战、将所领到魏上流五十里、伐苇数百万束缚作大筏欲顺流放火烧败浮桥、作筏适毕伺水长当下、下备陆口","evidence":["chenghuang-q-dc55f52f75ab6b5a64ff"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0063","role":"魏将、等围南郡分前部三万人作浮桥渡百里洲上、魏兵日渡不绝、便引退","evidence":["chenghuang-q-dc55f52f75ab6b5a64ff"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"会兵赴救未知所出","evidence":["chenghuang-q-dc55f52f75ab6b5a64ff"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0027","role":"同会兵赴救","evidence":["chenghuang-q-dc55f52f75ab6b5a64ff"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-dc55f52f75ab6b5a64ff"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-dc55f52f75ab6b5a64ff","source_order":[55,334,0],"order":9923}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0027","name":"杨粲","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o057","chenghuang-q-dc55f52f75ab6b5a64ff","zhulv-q-dd959cac71c7a1159a2e"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o057-wuzhu-p0027","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o057"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-dc55f52f75ab6b5a64ff","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-05b9092f0aa52d2daf07","layer":"original","quote":"魏将夏侯尚等围南郡，分前部三万人作浮桥，渡百里洲上〖13〗。诸葛瑾、杨粲，并会兵赴救，未知所出〖14〗。而魏兵日渡不绝，璋曰：“魏势始盛，江水又浅，未可与战。”便将所领，到魏上流五十里，伐苇数百万束，缚作大筏；欲顺流放火，烧败浮桥。作筏适毕，伺水长当下：尚便引退。璋下备陆口","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":137,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。马超的祠墓遗址，相传在今四川成都市新都区城南的马超小学内，曾有墓碑出土。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1fcace810489e51a4218","start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o034","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-7ddd1fa08ce5c9feb1d4","layer":"original","quote":"二年卒〖13〗，时年四十七。临没上疏曰：“臣门宗二百余口〖14〗，为孟德所诛略尽〖15〗；惟有从弟岱，当为微宗血食之继〖16〗，深托陛下。余无复言。”","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o057b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-18306c49b308c4280bb8","layer":"original","quote":"权遣吕范等督五军，以舟军拒休等；诸葛瑾、潘璋、杨粲救南郡；朱桓以濡须督拒仁〖11〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":48,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o054","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7e0fdf82962252602cbd","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年春正月〖1〗，陆逊部将军宋谦等〖2〗，攻蜀五屯；皆破之，斩其将。三月，鄱阳言黄龙现〖3〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o057","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-18306c49b308c4280bb8","layer":"original","quote":"秋九月，魏乃命曹休、张辽、臧霸出洞口〖9〗；曹仁出濡须；曹真、夏侯尚、张郃、徐晃围南郡〖10〗。权遣吕范等督五军，以舟军拒休等；诸葛瑾、潘璋、杨粲救南郡；朱桓以濡须督拒仁〖11〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-cf6f6b7751be45fab27c","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-f12e0ef1dd328cbd267c","layer":"pei","quote":"曹真、夏侯尚等，围朱然于江陵，又分据中州。瑾以大兵，为之救援。瑾性弘缓，推道理，任计画；无应猝倚伏之术，兵久不解：权以此望之。及春水生，潘璋等作水城于上流；瑾进攻浮桥，真等退走。虽无大勋，亦以全师保境为功","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0dd9b5681971d6dd244a","start":10,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-021a50d9b1b8fdeac66f","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-8065dd62573e2cf7ce53","layer":"original","quote":"权嘉桓功，封嘉兴侯，迁奋武将军〖22〗，领彭城相","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":152,"end":176,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-150286fc1d8c46dd011b","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-90783369b7053954e57c","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年，魏使大司马曹仁步骑数万，向濡须。仁欲以兵袭取州上〖10〗；伪先扬声〖11〗，欲东攻羡溪","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-28cc2b6a872b100b464d","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-8065dd62573e2cf7ce53","layer":"original","quote":"桓部兵将攻取油船，或别击雕等；桓等身自拒泰。 〔泰〕 烧营而退，遂枭雕〖20〗，生虏双，送武昌。临阵斩溺〖21〗，死者千余","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":90,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-3e1cf6b834a280c88d70","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-90783369b7053954e57c","layer":"original","quote":"桓分兵将赴羡溪；既发，猝得仁进军距濡须七十里问〖13〗。桓遣使追还羡溪兵，兵未到而仁奄至。时桓手下及所部兵，在者五千人；诸将业业〖14〗，各有惧心","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":53,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-9849145c4d07009638e5","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-8065dd62573e2cf7ce53","layer":"original","quote":"桓因偃旗鼓，外示虚弱，以诱致仁","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-d502b0b0a02e7af91f29","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-8065dd62573e2cf7ce53","layer":"original","quote":"仁果遣其子泰攻濡须城；分遣将军常雕督诸葛虔、王双等，乘油船别袭中洲〖17〗。中洲者，部曲妻子所在也〖18〗。仁自将万人留橐皋，复为泰等后拒","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-dd959cac71c7a1159a2e","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-6aeea7197e36b0f42123","layer":"original","quote":"权遣潘璋、杨粲等解〔围〕，而围不解","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":55,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-e54860898085b1ff7771","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f8dfdb59eae673d02fc7","layer":"original","quote":"桓喻之曰：“凡两军交对，胜负在将，不在众寡！诸君闻曹仁用兵行师，孰与桓邪？兵法所以称客倍而主人半者〖15〗，谓俱在平原，无城池之守，又谓士众勇怯齐等故耳。今仁既非智勇；加其士卒甚怯，又千里步涉，人马疲困。桓与诸君，共据高城；南临大江〖16〗，北背山陵；以逸待劳，为主制客：此百战百胜之势也。虽曹丕自来，尚不足忧；况仁等邪","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-ee40aacbf6f8efe027c7","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-6aeea7197e36b0f42123","layer":"original","quote":"权遣将军孙盛，督万人备州上〖1〗，立围坞，为然外救。郃渡兵攻盛，盛不能拒，即时却退。郃据州上围守，然中外断绝","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
